  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-session-settings",
      "text": "- **Host half** owns the per-session configuration truth and exposes the `sessionSettings` service\n  (register / get / set / reset / subscribe). Declarative items are registered from consumer host halves.\n- **Browser half** registers one native right-sidebar tab (id and kind: `session-settings`) that renders\n  every registered plugin's options for the session the tab belongs to.\n- Overrides are stored per session through the official storage domain\n  (`<DSH_HOME>/storages/session_settings/`); nothing is written into session logs or the profile patch."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-session-settings",
      "text": "Design: [docs/design-v1.md](docs/design-v1.md).\n\nStatus: 可用（宿主服务 + 浏览器页面 + 存储 + 桥接 + 界面）。依赖与升级对照见 [docs/dsh-dependencies.md](docs/dsh-dependencies.md)。"
    }
